==== Prepare ====

  * USB2Serial or USB2TTL tool
  * One Network cable
  * serial concole(putty or similar)
  * tftp server, (Ubuntu tftp-hpa; Windows: Tftpd32.exe)

Default IP for LAN is 192.168.169.1 there is a telnet server running, which can be accessed with login hame, password hame.
From there you can backup the current stock firmware with
<code>
